9
00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:29.213
unverified call unless
you pass allow unverified.

10
00:00:29.213 --> 00:00:33.042
Before you start, finish Module 1,
on the record and the six kinds,

11
00:00:33.042 --> 00:00:36.651
and read the honest limits
section of the provider notices

12
00:00:36.651 --> 00:00:40.187
chapter in Compliance Automation
and Day-Two Operations.

13
